msgid "For what only your backend sees, such as a signup or a payment. Track forwards the visitor’s address and browser, so the event joins their visit; requests with Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control are not sent. It needs an <0>API key</0> with the analytics:write scope, which stays on your server."
